<templates xml:space="preserve">
<t t-name="arg_pyme_catalogo.PriceMatrix">
<div class="arg_price_matrix h-100 overflow-auto p-3">
 <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-3"><h2 class="me-auto mb-0">Precios ARG</h2><button class="btn btn-success" t-if="this.state.canEdit" t-att-disabled="!this.dirty || this.state.loading || this.state.saving" t-on-click="this.review">Revisar y guardar (<t t-esc="this.changes.length"/>)</button><button class="btn btn-outline-danger" t-if="this.dirty" t-att-disabled="this.state.saving" t-on-click="this.discard">Descartar</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" t-on-click="this.advanced">Listas y reglas</button></div>
 <form class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-end gap-2 mb-2" t-on-submit.prevent="() => this.load(0)">
  <label>Buscar<input class="form-control" placeholder="Código o nombre" t-att-value="this.state.query" t-on-input="ev => this.state.query = ev.target.value"/></label>
  <label>Tipo<select class="form-select" t-att-value="this.state.kind" t-on-change="ev => this.state.kind = ev.target.value"><option value="">Todos</option><option value="consu">Productos</option><option value="service">Servicios</option></select></label>
  <label>Categoría<select class="form-select" t-att-value="this.state.category" t-on-change="ev => this.state.category = ev.target.value"><option value="">Todas</option><t t-foreach="this.state.categories" t-as="cat" t-key="cat.id"><option t-att-value="cat.id" t-esc="cat.name"/></t></select></label>
  <label>Cantidad de consulta<input class="form-control" type="number" min="0.0001" step="any" t-att-value="this.state.quantity" t-on-input="ev => this.state.quantity = ev.target.value" t-att-disabled="this.dirty"/></label><label>Fecha<input class="form-control" type="date" t-att-value="this.state.date" t-on-change="ev => this.state.date = ev.target.value" t-att-disabled="this.dirty"/></label>
  <label><input type="checkbox" t-att-checked="this.state.sale" t-on-change="ev => this.state.sale = ev.target.checked"/> Venta</label><label><input type="checkbox" t-att-checked="this.state.purchase" t-on-change="ev => this.state.purchase = ev.target.checked"/> Compra</label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" t-att-disabled="this.state.saving">Aplicar filtros</button>
 </form>
 <details class="mb-2"><summary>Columnas de listas (hasta cinco)</summary><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 p-2"><label t-foreach="this.state.lists" t-as="pl" t-key="pl.id"><input type="checkbox" t-att-checked="this.state.selected.includes(pl.id)" t-on-change="ev => this.toggleList(pl.id,ev)" t-att-disabled="this.state.saving"/> <t t-esc="pl.name"/> · <t t-esc="pl.currency"/></label></div></details>
 <p class="text-muted">Consulta por unidad de cada producto. Edición simple: una unidad, hoy, precio fijo de variante o sin regla. Los cambios ocultos se conservan hasta guardar o descartar.</p>
 <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert" t-if="this.state.error" t-esc="this.state.error"/><p role="status" t-if="this.state.loading">Cargando precios…</p>
 <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm table-bordered align-middle"><thead><tr><th>Código</th><th>Producto / servicio</th><th>Unidad</th><th t-if="this.state.canEdit">Costo</th><th t-foreach="this.state.columns" t-as="col" t-key="col.id"><t t-esc="col.name"/><div class="text-muted" t-esc="col.currency"/></th></tr></thead><tbody>
 <tr t-foreach="this.state.rows" t-as="row" t-key="row.id"><td t-esc="row.code"/><td t-esc="row.name"/><td t-esc="row.unit"/><td t-if="this.state.canEdit"><t t-esc="this.format(row.cost)"/> <t t-esc="row.cost_currency"/></td><td t-foreach="this.state.columns" t-as="col" t-key="col.id" t-att-class="this.state.pending[this.key(row,col)] ? 'arg_price_pending' : ''"><input aria-label="Precio" class="form-control text-end" type="number" step="any" min="0" t-att-value="this.value(row,col)" t-att-disabled="!this.state.canEdit || !this.cell(row,col).editable || this.state.saving || this.state.loading" t-att-title="this.cell(row,col).reason" t-on-change="ev => this.edit(row,col,ev)"/><small class="d-block text-warning" t-if="this.cell(row,col).price === null">Sin cotización efectiva</small><small t-if="this.state.canEdit" class="d-block text-muted">Margen actual: <t t-esc="this.format(this.cell(row,col).margin)"/> %</small></td></tr>
 <tr t-if="!this.state.rows.length &amp;&amp; !this.state.loading"><td t-att-colspan="this.state.columns.length + (this.state.canEdit ? 4 : 3)">Sin resultados. Revisá filtros y listas seleccionadas.</td></tr>
 </tbody></table></div>
 <div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-center"><button class="btn btn-secondary" t-att-disabled="!this.state.offset || this.state.loading" t-on-click="() => this.load(Math.max(0,this.state.offset-this.state.limit))">Anterior</button><span><t t-esc="this.state.offset + (this.state.rows.length ? 1 : 0)"/>–<t t-esc="this.state.offset+this.state.rows.length"/> de <t t-esc="this.state.count"/></span><button class="btn btn-secondary" t-att-disabled="this.state.offset+this.state.limit &gt;= this.state.count || this.state.loading" t-on-click="() => this.load(this.state.offset+this.state.limit)">Siguiente</button></div>
</div></t>
<t t-name="arg_pyme_catalogo.PriceReview"><Dialog title="'Revisar precios ARG'" size="'lg'"><p>Se guardarán únicamente estas celdas. Una modificación concurrente cancela todo el lote.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>Producto</th><th>Lista / moneda</th><th>Unidad</th><th>Anterior</th><th>Nuevo</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr t-foreach="this.props.changes" t-as="c" t-key="c.product_id + ':' + c.list_id"><td><t t-esc="c.code"/> · <t t-esc="c.name"/></td><td><t t-esc="c.list"/> · <t t-esc="c.currency"/></td><td t-esc="c.unit"/><td t-esc="c.before"/><td t-esc="c.price"/></tr></tbody></table></div><t t-set-slot="footer"><button class="btn btn-success" t-att-disabled="this.state.busy" t-on-click="this.apply">Confirmar cambios</button><button class="btn btn-secondary" t-att-disabled="this.state.busy" t-on-click="this.props.close">Volver</button></t></Dialog></t>
</templates>
